 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- ACP exposes native management and speech catalogs through `/omp`, reviewed atomic plans through `/commit-plan`, and encrypted collaboration through `/collab`, `/join`, and `/leave`. Hosts accept guest prompts only during an owning `/collab watch` turn.
+- Negotiated Core GUI components present native custom widgets, local themes, and focused keybindings through versioned form frames. ACP steering acknowledges injection into the current native turn and withdraws canceled queued inputs.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- ACP sessions now advertise and run prompts from client-provided MCP servers as slash commands, including prompts arriving after server startup. Reconfiguring a session clears stale prompt commands.
+
